---
import ScrollReveal from "../components/scroll/ScrollReveal.astro";
---

<html lang="es">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Página de prueba del componente ScrollReveal."
        />
        <title>Demo — ScrollReveal</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <main>
            <section class="intro">
                <span class="eyebrow">Componente / ScrollReveal</span>
                <h1>Entrada, salida y retorno en cada bloque.</h1>
                <p>Desplázate para ver cómo cada módulo entra desde abajo y se transforma al salir por la parte superior.</p>
                <span class="scroll-hint">Desplázate ↓</span>
            </section>

            <section class="demo-section demo-section--light">
                <ScrollReveal yOffset={90} exitScale={0.82} exitOpacity={0.12} exitYOffset={180}>
                    <div class="feature feature--statement">
                        <span class="eyebrow">01 / Bloque completo</span>
                        <h2>Una idea toma presencia al entrar en el viewport.</h2>
                        <p>Este contenido se eleva 90 px, aparece y luego se aleja con escala y opacidad ligadas al scroll.</p>
                    </div>
                </ScrollReveal>
            </section>

            <section class="demo-section demo-section--dark">
                <ScrollReveal stagger={true} staggerAmount={0.16} yOffset={70} exitScale={0.9} exitOpacity={0.25} exitYOffset={140}>
                    <div class="section-heading">
                        <span class="eyebrow">02 / Stagger activado</span>
                        <h2>Los hijos directos entran en cascada.</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-grid">
                        <article><span>01</span><h3>Detecta</h3><p>El bloque aparece al cruzar el 90% de la ventana.</p></article>
                        <article><span>02</span><h3>Revela</h3><p>Cada tarjeta conserva su propio retraso de entrada.</p></article>
                        <article><span>03</span><h3>Sale</h3><p>La composición reduce su escala al abandonar la escena.</p></article>
                    </div>
                </ScrollReveal>
            </section>

            <section class="demo-section demo-section--accent">
                <ScrollReveal delay={0.15} yOffset={120} exitScale={0.76} exitOpacity={0} exitYOffset={220}>
                    <div class="feature feature--closing">
                        <span class="eyebrow">03 / Retorno reversible</span>
                        <h2>Sube de nuevo: la animación vuelve a empezar.</h2>
                    </div>
                </ScrollReveal>
            </section>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
    :root { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; background: #071c2a; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; overflow-x: hidden; color: #071c2a; }
    .intro, .demo-section { min-height: 100svh; padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem); }
    .intro { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; color: #f7f2e9; background: radial-gradient(circle at 78% 28%, #ec6335 0 11%, transparent 36%), #071c2a; }
    .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .7; }
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 { max-width: 1000px; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 9rem); line-height: .88; letter-spacing: -.075em; }
    .intro p { max-width: 620px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .72; }
    .scroll-hint { margin-top: 5rem; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .demo-section { display: grid; align-items: center; }
    .demo-section--light { background: #f6f1e8; }
    .demo-section--dark { color: #f7f2e9; background: #102d3d; }
    .demo-section--accent { color: #071c2a; background: #e5673a; }
    .feature { width: min(100%, 1050px); }
    .feature h2, .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 1.8rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem); line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    .feature p { max-width: 580px; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem); line-height: 1.6; }
    .feature--statement { padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); border-left: 2px solid #e5673a; }
    .section-heading { max-width: 850px; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
    .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
    .feature-grid article { min-height: 270px; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
    .feature-grid article > span { color: #e5673a; font-weight: 800; }
    .feature-grid h3 { margin: 4rem 0 1rem; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .feature-grid p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; opacity: .7; }
    .feature--closing { max-width: 950px; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) { .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .feature-grid article { min-height: 190px; } .feature-grid h3 { margin-top: 2rem; } }
</style>
